WEBVTT

00:00:10.412 --> 00:00:14.075
<v><b>Alice:</b></v> I think, for the majority of people, that is the case,

00:00:14.075 --> 00:00:19.950
but I also think we can’t deny the fact that families come in all shapes and sizes.

00:00:25.361 --> 00:00:29.591
<v><b>James:</b></v> And as I’ve got older, and had, you know, kids and a family,

00:00:30.045 --> 00:00:31.956
that’s kind of taken centre stage.

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:41.508
<v><b>Debbie:</b></v> When I was younger, friends were really important, once my children came along,

00:00:41.507 --> 00:00:42.880
that was my main focus.

00:00:48.281 --> 00:00:50.529
<v><b>Debbie:</b></v> Everything that I had was invested in them,

00:00:50.701 --> 00:00:55.242
so therefore my family unit became the most important thing.

00:01:01.344 --> 00:01:05.754
<v><b>Debbie:</b></v> I have now discovered that as much as my family have been there for me,…

00:01:11.387 --> 00:01:15.329
<v><b>Debbie:</b></v> …my two sons have been my rocks, and they really have been amazing,…

00:01:21.307 --> 00:01:24.881
<v><b>Debbie:</b></v> …my friends are the ones that have got me through everything,

00:01:25.066 --> 00:01:29.533
because they are of the same age as me, the same generation.